s Rem Karolus, who carries Avacyn's broken spear and confirms she is dead.","participants":["thalia","grete","rem-karolus","avacyn-s-spear","avacyn"],"location":"gavony","importance":"major","page":"stories/saint-traft-and-flight-nightmares-2016-07-13","order":518,"story_date":"2016-07-13","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":20,"quote":"Even with its tip broken in a jagged line, Avacyn's spear was unmistakable.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/saint-traft-and-flight-nightmares-2016-07-13#:~:text=Even%20with%20its%20tip,Avacyn%27s%20spear%20was%20unmistakable.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Saint Traft and the Flight of Nightmares","series":"Magic Story","authors":["James Wyatt"],"date":"2016-07-13","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/saint-traft-and-flight-nightmares-2016-07-13","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/saint-traft-and-flight-nightmares-2016-07-13#:~:text=Even%20with%20its%20tip,Avacyn%27s%20spear%20was%20unmistakable.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Saint Traft and the Flight of Nightmares\" by James Wyatt. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 13 Jul 2016."}},{"id":"saint-traft-and-flight-nightmares-2016-07-13-e3","era":null,"summary":"With Saint Traft's power, Thalia lifts the spear and mounts it on her saddle as the order's banner.","participants":["thalia","saint-traft","avacyn-s-spear","rem-karolus"],"location":"gavony","importance":"major","page":"stories/saint-traft-and-flight-nightmares-2016-07-13","order":518,"story_date":"2016-07-13","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":35,"quote":"We ride under this banner now,","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/saint-traft-and-flight-nightmares-2016-07-13#:~:text=We%20ride%20under%20this%20banner%20now%2C","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Saint Traft and the Flight of Nightmares","series":"Magic Story","authors":["James Wyatt"],"date":"2016-07-13","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/saint-traft-and-flight-nightmares-2016-07-13","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/saint-traft-and-flight-nightmares-2016-07-13#:~:text=We%20ride%20under%20this%20banner%20now%2C","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Saint Traft and the Flight of Nightmares\" by James Wyatt. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 13 Jul 2016."}},{"id":"his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17-e1","era":null,"summary":"Vadrik meets the council of crones and mothers and the inquisitor Rem Karolus, who was hired by Dein Salvasi, and they agree to work together.","participants":["vadrik","rem-karolus","malynn","council-of-crones-and-mothers"],"location":"lambholt","importance":"minor","page":"stories/his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17","order":659,"story_date":"2021-09-19","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":34,"quote":"\"Then I suppose we'll be working together.\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17#:~:text=%22Then%20I%20suppose%20we%27ll%20be%20working%20together.%22","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"His Eyes, All of Them","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Margaret Killjoy"],"date":"2021-09-19","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17#:~:text=%22Then%20I%20suppose%20we%27ll%20be%20working%20together.%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"His Eyes, All of Them\" by Margaret Killjoy. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 19 Sep 2021."}},{"id":"his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17-e4","era":null,"summary":"Vadrik examines three bodies in a pasture, one a werewolf reverted on death, all pierced as if by arrows.","participants":["vadrik","rem-karolus","malynn"],"location":"lambholt","importance":"minor","page":"stories/his-eyes-a