ic.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"His Eyes, All of Them\" by Margaret Killjoy. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 19 Sep 2021."}},{"id":"his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17-e6","era":null,"summary":"The two follow the tracks to an aspen grove where Old Stickfingers appears behind Vadrik.","participants":["vadrik","rem-karolus","old-stickfingers"],"location":"lambholt","importance":"major","page":"stories/his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17","order":659,"story_date":"2021-09-19","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":88,"quote":"Old Stickfingers lived up to his name.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17#:~:text=Old%20Stickfingers%20lived%20up%20to%20his%20name.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"His Eyes, All of Them","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Margaret Killjoy"],"date":"2021-09-19","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17#:~:text=Old%20Stickfingers%20lived%20up%20to%20his%20name.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"His Eyes, All of Them\" by Margaret Killjoy. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 19 Sep 2021."}},{"id":"his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17-e7","era":null,"summary":"Rem stabs Stickfingers and Vadrik blasts him with ice; Rem drives his blade through the creature's face and it vanishes.","participants":["vadrik","rem-karolus","old-stickfingers"],"location":"lambholt","importance":"major","page":"stories/his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17","order":659,"story_date":"2021-09-19","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":100,"quote":"Rem stood up and drove his blade through the beast's chin, up through his face.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17#:~:text=Rem%20stood%20up%20and,up%20through%20his%20face.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"His Eyes, All of Them","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Margaret Killjoy"],"date":"2021-09-19","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17#:~:text=Rem%20stood%20up%20and,up%20through%20his%20face.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"His Eyes, All of Them\" by Margaret Killjoy. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 19 Sep 2021."}},{"id":"his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17-e8","era":null,"summary":"In the morning Vadrik meets Ariosa, Arinos's daughter, and sets out to investigate the Salvasi manor.","participants":["vadrik","malynn","ariosa","rem-karolus"],"location":"lambholt","importance":"minor","page":"stories/his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17","order":659,"story_date":"2021-09-19","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":118,"quote":"\"Vadrik, meet Ariosa. Daughter of Arinos.\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17#:~:text=%22Vadrik%2C%20meet%20Ariosa.%20Daughter%20of%20Arinos.%22","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"His Eyes, All of Them","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Margaret Killjoy"],"date":"2021-09-19","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17#:~:text=%22Vadrik%2C%20meet%20Ariosa.%20Daughter%20of%20Arinos.%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"His Eyes, All of Them\" by Margaret Killjoy. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 19 Sep 2021."}},{"id":"his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17-e9","era":null,"summary":"At the Salvasi manor Vadrik and Rem find a broken door, an empty house, signs of violence and a message in ash, and Vadrik finds black goat fur.","participants":["vadrik","rem-karolus"],"location":"salvasi-manor","importance":"minor","page":"stories/his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17","order":659,"story_date":"2021-09-19","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":136,"quote":"Instead of a warm welcome and food, the pair found a door broken open, hanging from one hinge.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17#:~:text=Instead%20of%20a%20warm,hanging%20from%20one%20hinge.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"His Eyes, All of Them","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Margaret Killjoy"],"date":"2021-09-19","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17#:~:text=Instead%20of%20a%20warm,hanging%20from%20one%20hinge.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"His Eyes, All of Them\" by Margaret Killjoy. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 19 Sep 2021."}},{"id":"his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17-e10","era":null,"summary":"At Arinos's farm Vadrik finds a twig mobile and deduces that Arinos summoned Stickfingers to get rid of Salvasi.","participants":["vadrik","rem-karolus","stickfingers-mobile"],"location":"lambholt","importance":"major","page":"stories/his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17","order":659,"story_date":"2021-09-19","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":149,"quote":"\"Arinos summoned Stickfingers to dispose of Salvasi and save his farm,\" Vadrik said.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17#:~:text=%22Arinos%20summoned%20Stickfingers%20to,his%20farm%2C%22%20Vadrik%20said.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"His Eyes, All of Them","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Margaret Killjoy"],"date":"2021-09-19","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17#:~:text=%22Arinos%20summoned%20Stickfingers%20to,his%20farm%2C%22%20Vadrik%20said.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"His Eyes, All of Them\" by Margaret Killjoy. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 19 Sep 2021."}},{"id":"his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17-e12","era":null,"summary":"The village bell tolls: Stickfingers is inside the walls, and Ariosa says that Vadrik and Rem set him free.","participants":["vadrik","rem-karolus","ariosa","malynn","old-stickfingers"],"location":"lambholt","importance":"major","page":"stories/his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17","order":659,"story_date":"2021-09-19","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":178,"quote":"\"Just came from home,\" she said to Malynn, then she looked daggers at the pair of men. \"They set him free.\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17#:~:text=%22Just%20came%20from%20home%2C%22,%22They%20set%20him%20free.%22","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"His Eyes, All of Them","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Margaret Killjoy"],"date":"2021-09-19","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17#:~:text=%22Just%20came%20from%20home%2C%22,%22They%20set%20him%20free.%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"His Eyes, All of Them\" by Margaret Killjoy. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 19 Sep 2021."}},{"id":"his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17-e14","era":null,"summary":"Vadrik works out that Arinos did not finish the summoning, so Stickfingers killed intruders on the old estate's land; Rem holds the monster back and Vadrik heals him.","participants":["vadrik","ariosa","rem-karolus","old-stickfingers"],"location":"lambholt","importance":"minor","page":"stories/his-eyes-all-them-2021-09-17","order":659,"story_date":"2021-09-19","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":